<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ESS estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ESS estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hambrecht &amp; Quist analyst Robert Chapinsky raised his fourth-quarter earnings estimate for ESS Technology to $0.37 a share from $0.35.</p>
<p>--Chapinsky raised his estimate for fiscal 1996 earnings to $1.21 a share from $1.18 and his forecast for fiscal 1997 to $1.72 from $1.62.</p>
<p>--The stock's rating remains a strong buy.</p>
<p>--Shares of ESS were 1-3/8 higher at 24-7/8 in early afternoon trading in the Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
